{"title":"Great Luna Moth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 42 Moth that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 9 times (1.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonwing-dust\">Moonwing Dust</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>135</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>804</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>769</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>135</td><td>in the wilds around 1666, 1563</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>804</td><td>in the wilds around 1501, 1469</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>769</td><td>in the wilds around 1503, 1461</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 35 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"moth-silk\" title=\"Moth Silk - in 69% of 35 looted corpses, 20 recorded drops, 41 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d15d8530734f756ad4c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moth Silk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">69% · 24/35</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"luna-wing\" title=\"Luna Wing - in 60% of 35 looted corpses, 19 recorded drops, 45 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9dfc6bd97d5a343b2a88.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Luna Wing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">60% · 21/35</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 9% of 35 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">9% · 3/35</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 35 looted corpses, 1 recor